  "title": "Dried Apricot Pie",
  "description": "Sliced, dried apricots are heated up in water, mixed with orange liqueur, sugar, and cornstarch and poured into an unbaked pie shell. An hour later, the pie emerges warm, luscious and very apricoty.",
  "authors": [
